Hanumān drops into flowering Aśōkavana scattering birds and blossoms --- Shaken trees shed flowers and stand stripped and birdless --- Hanumān sees jeweled grounds lotus ponds hill river and palaces --- Hanumān finds golden creeper-wrapped Śiṃśapā tree --- Hanumān climbs Śiṃśapā to watch for Vaidēhī --- Hanumān hopes grieving Sītā visits holy river at twilight
